%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 97, "reading_minutes": 0.3, "lead": "中国の養豚会社Shennongの社長が離婚しました。会社の株の一部を元の妻にわたします。豚の値段が下がる中での決定です。", "lead_zh": "中国养猪企业Shennong的董事长离婚了。他把公司一部分股份转给了前妻。此时猪价正在下跌。", "preview": "社長の何祖訓さんは、持っている株の30%を元の妻の羅婉瑜さんにわたします。金額は約248億元です。二人はこれからも一緒に会社を動かします。", "preview_zh": "董事长何祖训把所持股份的30%转给前妻罗婉瑜，价值约248亿元。两人今后仍共同经营公司。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 920, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 14.3, "size_bytes": 129024, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 52, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/versions/936.json"}, {"content_hash": "0e5a972460b14576", "version_id": 937, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "豚肉価格が下落、Shennong Groupの社長が離婚で株式を分割", "title_zh": "猪肉价格下跌，神农集团董事长离婚分割股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 132, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "中国の養豚会社Shennong Groupの社長が離婚しました。会社の株式の一部を元妻にわたします。会社は今、豚肉価格の下落でお金を大切に使っています。", "lead_zh": "中国养猪企业神农集团的董事长离婚了，把一部分公司股份转给前妻。公司眼下正因猪肉价格下跌而精打细算。", "preview": "Shennong Groupは雲南省の大きな養豚会社です。社長のHe Zuxunさんは、持っている株式の30%を元妻のLuo Wanyuさんにわたしました。金額は約24.8億元です。二人はこれからも一緒に会社を動かします。", "preview_zh": "神农集团是云南的大型养猪企业。董事长何祖训把所持股份的30%转给了前妻罗婉瑜，价值约24.8亿元。两人今后仍将共同掌控公司。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 921, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 18.825, "size_bytes": 194688, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 63, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/versions/937.json"}, {"content_hash": "bc3689309a66e01c", "version_id": 938, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "豚価格下落の中、神農集団の会長が離婚で株の15%を移す", "title_zh": "猪价下跌之际，神农集团董事长离婚，转出15%股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 212, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "中国の養豚大手・神農集団の何祖訓会長が、妻との離婚に伴い保有株の一部を前妻に移しました。業界は豚価格の下落で厳しい時期にあり、会社は現金確保を最優先にしています。", "lead_zh": "中国养猪巨头神农集团的董事长何祖训因离婚，把部分持股转给了前妻。行业正处在猪价下跌的艰难时期，公司把保住现金放在第一位。", "preview": "神農集団は雲南省を本拠地とする養豚大手です。何祖訓氏は保有する2億6100万株のうち30%、7830万5000株を元妻の羅婉瑜氏に移しました。発表日の終値で計算すると、約24億8200万元になります。", "preview_zh": "神农集团是总部位于云南的养猪巨头。何祖训把持有的2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股转给了前妻罗婉瑜。按公告日收盘价计算，约合24.82亿元。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 922, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 26.0, "size_bytes": 288720, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 85, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/versions/938.json"}, {"content_hash": "8d9268f83af7e329", "version_id": 939, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "養豚大手・神農集団の会長が離婚、元妻に約24億元分の株を移転", "title_zh": "养猪巨头神农集团董事长离婚，向前妻转让约24亿元股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 259, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "中国雲南省の養豚大手・神農集団の何祖訓会長が離婚し、保有株の一部を元妻に移転した。豚価格の下落が続く中、会社は現金確保を最優先にしており、後継者問題にも新たな変数が生じている。", "lead_zh": "中国云南养猪巨头神农集团的董事长何祖训离婚，将部分持股转让给前妻。在猪价持续下跌的背景下，公司把保住现金放在首位，接班人问题也出现了新的变数。", "preview": "神農集団の公告によると、何祖訓氏は保有する2億6100万株のうち30％にあたる7830万5000株を元妻の羅婉瑜氏に移転する。公告日の終値で計算すると、時価総額は約24億8200万元になる。両氏は行動を共にする契約を結び、会社の支配権は変わらないとしている。", "preview_zh": "根据神农集团的公告，何祖训将所持2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股转让给前妻罗婉瑜。按公告日收盘价计算，市值约24.82亿元。双方签署了一致行动协议，公司控制权保持不变。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 915, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 14.3, "size_bytes": 331920, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 88, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/versions/939.json"}, {"content_hash": "6844425a269e3063", "version_id": 940, "article_id": 94, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "豚価下落続く中、神農集団の創業者が離婚で24億元分の株を移転", "title_zh": "猪价持续下跌之际，神农集团实控人离婚，分割24亿元股份", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8198696.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554228168-dfcd8cbe15fe?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Y2hpbmVzZSUyMHBpZyUyMGZhcm1lcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0MzYwMTc2fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Ben Mater on Unsplash", "author": "Ben Mater", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@benjmater?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/woman-sitting-in-front-of-pig-ek56eeYMKoQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(257, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(295, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "ce5155df2307"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-11", "word_count": 338, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "豚肉価格の低迷が続くなか、雲南省の養豚大手・神農集団の創業者である何祖訓会長が離婚し、保有株式の一部を元妻に移転した。一族による企業統治と次世代への承継に、新たな不透明要因が生じている。", "lead_zh": "在猪肉价格持续低迷的背景下，云南养猪巨头神农集团创始人、董事长何祖训离婚，将部分持股转让给前妻。家族企业治理与二代接班因此增添了新的不确定因素。", "preview": "神農集団がこのほど開示した公告によると、何祖訓氏は元妻の羅婉瑜氏との婚姻関係を解消し、保有する2億6100万株のうち30％にあたる7830万5000株を羅氏に移転する。公告日の終値31.7元で試算すると、時価総額は約24億8200万元に上る。両氏は行動一致協議にも署名しており、上", "preview_zh": "神农集团近日披露公告称，何祖训与罗婉瑜解除婚姻关系，将其持有的2.61亿股中的30%、即7830.5万股转让给罗氏。按公告日收盘价31.7元测算，对应市值约24.82亿元。双方还签署了一致行动协议，上市公司控制权维持不变。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 923, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/94/ja_n1.mp3", "duration": 36.0, "size_bytes": 421344, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 110, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/versions/940.json"}]}}, "dates": ["2026-11-11", "2026-11-10", "2026-11-09", "2026-11-08", "2026-11-07", "2026-11-06", "2026-11-05", "2026-11-04", "2026-11-03", "2026-11-02", "2026-11-01", "2026-10-31", "2026-10-30", "2026-10-29"], "base_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content", "index_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@f6e87f8/content/data/index.json", "version": {"published_at": "2026-11-11T01:56:46.283129+00:00", "content_hash": "89907b8cea7d", "tip": "本文件即最新版；若published_at 明显早于当前时间，说明命中了 CDN 旧缓存"}, "levels": [{"code": "en_a1", "label": "A1 入门", "lang": "en", "level": 1}, {"code": "en_a2", "label": "A2 初级", "lang": "en", "level": 2}, {"code": "en_b1", "label": "B1 中级", "lang": "en", "level": 3}, {"code": "en_b2", "label": "B2 中高级", "lang": "en", "level": 4}, {"code": "en_c1", "label": "C1 高级", "lang": "en", "level": 5}, {"code": "ja_n5", "label": "N5 初級", "lang": "ja", "level": 1}, {"code": "ja_n4", "label": "N4 初級", "lang": "ja", "level": 2}, {"code": "ja_n3", "label": "N3 中級", "lang": "ja", "level": 3}, {"code": "ja_n2", "label": "N2 中高級", "lang": "ja", "level": 4}, {"code": "ja_n1", "label": "N1 上級", "lang": "ja", "level": 5}]}